      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} Nerp. This was an Udon example with a script I've copied and modified with several backups sourced under assets, not packages. Backups from two days ago and two months both showed all modifications and variables stripped. Even renaming the files and editing the object name in Notepad++ and opening them in a completely different project and SDK altogether did not stop the backups from completely failing.\n\nThis is unstable and dangerous code. No one should use any of the Udon examples for anything in their maps at all. Modifications will be overwritten.",
